    type: filing
    name: Audited financial statements, FY2024-25
    summary: BDO's opinion on the statements for the year to 30 June 2025 and the first period, dated 2026-03-06, with an emphasis-of-matter paragraph on the restatement of the 2024 statements.
    entity: C:entity/wikimedia-endowment
    kind: audit-report
    period: 2024-07..2025-06
    url: "https://wikimediaendowment.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Wikimedia-Endowment-Audit-Report-FY-24-25.pdf"
    status: active
    visibility: public
    owner: O:role/treasurer
