  - id: C:event/announced
    type: event
    name: Creation of the Endowment announced
    summary: In January 2016 the Foundation announces the Endowment, run in its early years as a donor-advised fund at the Tides Foundation.
    year: 2016
    visibility: public
    provenance: {mode: net-scan, sources: ["https://foundation.wikimedia.org/wiki/Memory:Timeline", "https://wikimediaendowment.org/annualreports/2024-2025-annual-report/"], confidence: 0.8, state: known}

  - id: C:event/irs-recognition
    type: event
    name: IRS recognises the Endowment
    summary: The IRS letter of 2022-06-28 recognises the Endowment as exempt under section 501(c)(3), as preparation for standing alone.
    at: 2022-06-28
    visibility: public
    provenance: {mode: net-scan, sources: ["https://foundation.wikimedia.org/wiki/Endowment:Main", "https://wikimediaendowment.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Wikimedia-Endowment-Audit-Report-FY-24-25.pdf"], confidence: 0.9, state: known}

  - id: C:event/grantmaking-begins
    type: event
    name: Grantmaking begins after reaching $100 million
    summary: The Endowment begins making grants in 2023, after the fund reaches $100 million in value.
    year: 2023
    visibility: public
    provenance: {mode: net-scan, sources: ["https://wikimediaendowment.org/annualreports/2024-2025-annual-report/"], confidence: 0.8, state: known}

  - id: C:event/standalone
    type: event
    name: Standalone organization
    summary: On 2023-09-30 the Endowment becomes a standalone 501(c)(3) with its own Board of Directors and receives $116.2M from the Tides Foundation.
    at: 2023-09-30
    visibility: public
    provenance: {mode: net-scan, sources: ["https://wikimediaendowment.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Wikimedia-Endowment-Audit-Report-FY-24-25.pdf", "https://meta.wikimedia.org/wiki/Wikimedia_Endowment_reports/Financial/Form_990/2024-2025_-_frequently_asked_questions", "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/foundation/3/3f/Wikimedia_Foundation_FY_24-25_Audit_Report.pdf"], confidence: 0.9, state: known}
